    "><a class="c-subheader__title" href="/uc/cega"><h1>Center for Effective Global Action</h1></a><a class="c-subheader__banner" href="/uc/cega"><img src="/cms-assets/7b8f8ce25b368a1a9f903a5873afcff53a5cf51601080deda06d77ee91bee14c" alt="CEGA Working Papers banner"/></a><a class="c-subheader__campus" href="/uc/ucb">UC Berkeley</a><div id="wizardModalBase" class="c-subheader__buttons"><button id="wizardlyDeposit" class="o-button__3">Deposit</button><div class="c-modal"></div><button id="wizardlyManage" class="o-button__3">Manage<span class="c-subheader__button-fragment">Submissions</span></button><div class="c-modal"></div></div></div><div class="c-navbar"><nav class="c-nav"><details open="" class="c-nav__main"><summary class="c-nav__main-button">Menu</summary><ul class="c-nav__main-items"><li><a href="/uc/cega">Unit Home</a></li><li><a href="/uc/cega/policyStatement">Policies</a></li><li><a href="/uc/cega/contactUs">Contact</a></li><li><a href="https://cega.berkeley.edu/">CEGA Homepage</a></li></ul></details></nav><div class="c-socialicons"><a href="http://www.facebook.com/CenterforEffectiveGlobalAction/"><img src="/images/logo_facebook-circle-black.svg" alt="Facebook"/></a><a href="/rss/unit/cega_wps"><img src="/images/logo_rss-circle-black.svg" alt="RSS"/></a></div></div><nav class="c-breadcrumb"><ul><li><a href="/">eScholarship</a></li><li><a href="/uc/ucb">UC Berkeley</a></li><li><a href="/uc/cega">Center for Effective Global Action</a></li><li><a class="c-breadcrumb-link--active" href="/uc/cega_wps">CEGA Working Papers</a></li></ul></nav><div class="c-columns--sticky-sidebar"><main id="maincontent"><div><div class="c-itemactions"><div class="o-download"><a href="/content/qt3d11905j/qt3d11905j.pdf" class="o-download__button" download="eScholarship UC item 3d11905j.pdf">Download <!-- -->PDF</a><details class="o-download__formats"><summary aria-label="formats"></summary><div><ul class="o-download__nested-menu"><li class="o-download__nested-list1">Main<ul><li><a href="/content/qt3d11905j/qt3d11905j.pdf" download="eScholarship UC item 3d11905j.pdf">PDF</a></li></ul></li></ul></div></details></div><details class="c-share"><summary><span>Share</span></summary><div><div class="c-share__list"><a class="c-share__email" href="">Email</a><a class="c-share__facebook" href="">Facebook</a></div></div></details></div></div><h2 class="c-tabcontent__main-heading" tabindex="-1"><div class="c-clientmarkup">Intergenerational Child Mortality Impacts of Deworming: Experimental Evidence from Two Decades of the Kenya Life Panel Survey</div></h2><div class="c-authorlist"><time class="c-authorlist__year">2023</time><ul class="c-authorlist__list u-truncate-lines"><li class="c-authorlist__begin"><a href="/search/?q=author%3AWalker%2C%20Michael">Walker, Michael</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AHuang%2C%20Alice">Huang, Alice</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AAsman%2C%20Suleiman">Asman, Suleiman</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3ABaird%2C%20Sarah">Baird, Sarah</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AFernald%2C%20Lia">Fernald, Lia</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AHamory%2C%20Joan">Hamory, Joan</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AHoces%20de%20la%20Guardia%2C%20Fernando">Hoces de la Guardia, Fernando</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AKoiso%2C%20Satoshi">Koiso, Satoshi</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AKremer%2C%20Michael">Kremer, Michael</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AKrupoff%2C%20Matthew%20N">Krupoff, Matthew N</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3ALayvant%2C%20Michelle">Layvant, Michelle</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AOchieng%2C%20Eric">Ochieng, Eric</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3ASuri%2C%20Pooja">Suri, Pooja</a>; </li><li class="c-authorlist__end"><a href="/search/?q=author%3AMiguel%2C%20Edward">Miguel, Edward</a> </li></ul><a href="#author" class="c-authorlist__list-more-link">et al.</a></div><div class="c-pubinfo"><div class="pub-links-container"><h2 class="c-pubinfo__location-heading">Published Web Location</h2><a href="https://doi.org/10.26085/C3XK5D" class="c-pubinfo__link">https://doi.org/10.26085/C3XK5D</a></div></div><div class="c-tabs"><div class="c-tabs__tabs"><button class="c-tabs__button-more" aria-label="Show all tabs">...</button><button class="c-tabs__button--active">Main Content</button><button class="c-tabs__button">Metrics</button><button class="c-tabs__button">Author &amp; <!-- -->Article<!-- --> Info</button></div><div class="c-tabs__content"><div class="c-tabcontent"><a name="article_abstract"></a><details class="c-togglecontent" open=""><summary>Abstract</summary><div id="abstract-text"><div class="c-clientmarkup"><p>We assess the impacts of a randomized school-based deworming intervention in Kenya on the mortality of recipients’ children using a 23-year longitudinal data set of over 6,500 original participants and their offspring. The under-5 mortality rate fell by 22% (17 deaths per 1000 live births) for children of treatment group individuals. We find that a combination of improved health, education, and living standards, increased urban residence, delayed fertility, and greater use of health care in the parent generation contributed to the reduction. The results provide evidence for meaningful intergenerational benefits of child health investments</p></div></div></details></div><p><br/></p></div></div></main><aside><section class="o-columnbox1"><header><h2>Jump To</h2></header><div class="c-jump"><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Article</a><ul class="c-jump__tree" aria-labelledby="c-jump__label"><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">WPS Cover Page Template (1)</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">KLPS-IGCM-Paper_2023-03-31</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Research Design &amp; Data</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Empirical methods</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Results</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Cost Benefit Analysis</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Discussion</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Additional exhibits (for online publication)</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Additional study background details</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Variable construction</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Details of cost-benefit calculation</a></li></ul><ul class="c-jump__siblings"><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Metrics</a></li><li><a href="/uc/item/3d11905j">Author &amp; <!-- -->Article<!-- --> Info</a></li></ul></div></section><div><section class="o-columnbox1"><header><h2>Related Items</h2></header><ul class="c-relateditems"><li><h3><a class="o-textlink__secondary" href="/uc/item/18v0r6ks"><div class="c-clientmarkup">Financial Literacy and Entrepreneurial Aspirations: Results from Pilot Experiments in India, Peru, and Uganda</div></a></h3><div class="c-authorlist"><ul class="c-authorlist__list u-truncate-lines" style="--line-clamp-lines:2"><li class="c-authorlist__begin"><a href="/search/?q=author%3AAgasha%2C%20Ester">Agasha, Ester</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AHobbs%2C%20Andrew">Hobbs, Andrew</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AShaji%2C%20Akash">Shaji, Akash</a>; </li><li class="c-authorlist__end"><a href="/search/?q=author%3AWydick%2C%20Bruce">Wydick, Bruce</a> </li></ul></div></li><li><h3><a class="o-textlink__secondary" href="/uc/item/3kw4303q"><div class="c-clientmarkup">Navigating Business Interactions: Female Entrepreneurs’ Preferences over Gender, Timing, and Harassment Reputation</div></a></h3><div class="c-authorlist"><ul class="c-authorlist__list u-truncate-lines" style="--line-clamp-lines:2"><li class="c-authorlist__begin"><a href="/search/?q=author%3ASheth%2C%20Ketki">Sheth, Ketki</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AManian%2C%20Shanthi">Manian, Shanthi</a>; </li><li class="c-authorlist__end"><a href="/search/?q=author%3ACrane%2C%20Trinity">Crane, Trinity</a> </li></ul></div></li><li><h3><a class="o-textlink__secondary" href="/uc/item/4s40w87j"><div class="c-clientmarkup">Can Cash Transfers Save Lives? Evidence from a Large-Scale Experiment in Kenya</div></a></h3><div class="c-authorlist"><ul class="c-authorlist__list u-truncate-lines" style="--line-clamp-lines:2"><li class="c-authorlist__begin"><a href="/search/?q=author%3AMichael%2C%20Walker">Michael, Walker</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AShankar%2C%20Nick">Shankar, Nick</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AMiguel%2C%20Edward">Miguel, Edward</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AEgger%2C%20Dennis">Egger, Dennis</a>; </li><li class="c-authorlist__end"><a href="/search/?q=author%3AKilleen%2C%20Grady">Killeen, Grady</a> </li></ul></div></li><li><h3><a class="o-textlink__secondary" href="/uc/item/66q929g4"><div class="c-clientmarkup">Mapping on a Budget: Optimizing Spatial Data Collection for ML</div></a></h3><div class="c-authorlist"><ul class="c-authorlist__list u-truncate-lines" style="--line-clamp-lines:2"><li class="c-authorlist__begin"><a href="/search/?q=author%3ABetti%2C%20Livia">Betti, Livia</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3ASanni%2C%20Farooq">Sanni, Farooq</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3ASogoyou%2C%20Gnouyaro">Sogoyou, Gnouyaro</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AAgbagla%2C%20Togbe">Agbagla, Togbe</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AMolitor%2C%20Cullen">Molitor, Cullen</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3ACarleton%2C%20Tamma">Carleton, Tamma</a>; </li><li class="c-authorlist__end"><a href="/search/?q=author%3ARolf%2C%20Esther">Rolf, Esther</a> </li></ul></div></li><li><h3><a class="o-textlink__secondary" href="/uc/item/8zk2h520"><div class="c-clientmarkup">Assessing Reproducibility in Economics Using Standardized Crowd-sourced Analysis</div></a></h3><div class="c-authorlist"><ul class="c-authorlist__list u-truncate-lines" style="--line-clamp-lines:2"><li class="c-authorlist__begin"><a href="/search/?q=author%3ABrodeur%2C%20Abel">Brodeur, Abel</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3ASung%2C%20Seung%20Yong">Sung, Seung Yong</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AMiguel%2C%20Edward">Miguel, Edward</a>; </li><li><a href="/search/?q=author%3AVilhuber%2C%20Lars">Vilhuber, Lars</a>; </li><li class="c-authorlist__end"><a href="/search/?q=author%3AHoces%20de%20la%20Guardia%2C%20Fernando">Hoces de la Guardia, Fernando</a> </li></ul></div></li></ul></section></div></aside></div></div><div><div class="c-toplink"><a href="javascript:window.scrollTo(0, 0)">Top</a></div><footer class="c-footer"><nav class="c-footer__nav"><ul><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/aboutEschol">About eScholarship</a></li><li><a href="/campuses">Campus Sites</a></li><li><a href="/ucoapolicies">UC Open Access Policy</a></li><li><a href="/publishing">eScholarship Publishing</a></li><li><a href="https://www.cdlib.org/about/accessibility.html">Accessibility</a></li><li><a href="/privacypolicy">Privacy Statement</a></li><li><a href="/policies">Site Policies</a></li><li><a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a></li><li><a href="/login"><strong>Admin Login</strong></a></li><li><a href="https://help.escholarship.org"><strong>Help</strong></a></li></ul></nav><div class="c-footer__logo"><a href="/"><img class="c-lazyimage" data-src="/images/logo_footer-eschol.svg" alt="eScholarship, University of California"/></a></div><div class="c-footer__copyright">Powered by the<br/><a href="http://www.cdlib.org">California Digital Library</a><br/>Copyright © 2017<br/>The Regents of the University of California</div></footer></div></div></div></div>
